#, no-wrap
msgid "Exercise 3: Build the teleportation circuit {#exercise-3-build-the-teleportation-circuit}"
msgstr "Exercițiul 3: Construiește Circuit-ul de teleportare {#exercise-3-build-the-teleportation-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
